  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Odb 402.26 “Upload submittal” means a reimbursement request submitted via the department One Stop Data Provider web site https://www4.des.state.nh.us/OnestopDataProviders/DESLogin.aspx, or successor systems, in portable document format (PDF).\n\nSource. #12942, eff 12-15-19",
